  "translation": "O waati min na, u nana masakɛ ka ɲɛfɛ, u ye kuma fɔ masakɛ ka sariya kunko la ko: yala i ma sariya sɛbɛn ko mɔgɔ bɛɛ min bɛna wele bɔ Ala walima mɔgɔ si la, don tananu kɔnɔ, ni i tɛ min de ye, ⟨masakɛ⟩, bɛna bɔ a bila waraba dugubu la wa? Masakɛ ye jaabi, a ko: kuma in ye tiɲɛ ye, Medi ni Perisi ka sariya ye, min tɛ yɛlɛma.",
